<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-23T18:32:45.494Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:32:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army and the Rapid Support Forces have intensified drone attacks, with a strike on a market in Abyei killing more than 150 civilians. RSF fighters have deliberately targeted hospitals in el-Fasher, further restricting medical care. Drought and El Niño are increasing famine risk across war-torn Sudan. The UN is resuming peace efforts to end the drone war and address the humanitarian crisis. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/21/world/africa/sudan-drone-strikes.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168638&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQS2VIUXB6aVR4Y2EtS1VfTUdwTWluTl8wTm45ejlidldTbExlVmlkY25fcUliRXNVa2lGUl9xcjhmS3ZHc3NjU3dEQTRxcVAwMkF3YmczX0wxT09LbExRQ1ppSTJQdjZ0U1YtZGlOVVpTMERRRTZzMXN3d3MyeS1iZEp2Zld6aWl0VFpCQUFHUDNxRWJUcm1Hbk1vYmlTU0d4bl9ZU0lR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9qNUhwT083MHNvS2ZOVG55OXEyNEpUVXZRMFh6X0Vhcmd0UTlHN29hb2tFelpjdGhRN1JXdVdWb2t6aTRqWmxBRnNXNHAyVGphMmdVSkNwNmdmWjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPd05QVnpyM1N2MkZaeUo5ZnJfRnRwbjFDYkF1VlRibHVZRGhWRXVoVXh1aFNxNmRfU1VMZm44MFQzUTBiWE1NSWtHTkRIS2hxRUQ1YkUyRV9tYmJHYjBSY2RVUmJiXzhycTMxRE9SNy1iWGxRQno5TG0yUnBaLXF0UFRHQk14TE1FNTZoMWpkQ0dDX3c5WHhNa3RmTGd5WXN6WU9UbHlGQXg0Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c54g1kxw4nvvo&quot;&gt;bbc.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/22/how-sudans-shift-to-drone-warfare-is-fuelling-a-civilian-crisis&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
